{"id":"6983c729bb4a6b9e","group":"89","path":"89/89-fact-box-bisimulation.md","title":"fact-box-bisimulation — Box Preserved by Bisimulation","display":"fact-box-bisimulation — Box Preserved by Bisimulation","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-fact-box-bisimulation","aliases":["89-fact-box-bisimulation"],"display":"fact-box-bisimulation — Box Preserved by Bisimulation","depends_on":["[[89-df-bisimulation]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-lem-bisimulation-invariance]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-fact-box-bisimulation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-fact-box-bisimulation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-box-bisimulation — Box Preserved by Bisimulation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f233d5485efaad7c\" href=\"?note=f233d5485efaad7c\" title=\"89-df-bisimulation\">89-df-bisimulation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a5213da99983a05a\" href=\"?note=a5213da99983a05a\" title=\"89-lem-bisimulation-invariance\">89-lem-bisimulation-invariance</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)\">\\(\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{N}=(W&#39;,R&#39;,V&#39;)\">\\(\\mathcal{N}=(W&#39;,R&#39;,V&#39;)\\)</span> are Kripke models.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\subseteq W\\times W&#39;\">\\(Z\\subseteq W\\times W&#39;\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(w,v)\\in Z\">\\((w,v)\\in Z\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}box\\text{-}bisimulation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\Box\\varphi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{N},v\\models\\Box\\varphi\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}box\\text{-}bisimulation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\Box\\varphi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{N},v\\models\\Box\\varphi\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> : 互模拟 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f233d5485efaad7c\" href=\"?note=f233d5485efaad7c\" title=\"89-df-bisimulation\">89-df-bisimulation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> : 模态算子 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a>)</li>\n<li>Box公式在互模拟点间保持</li>\n<li>这是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a5213da99983a05a\" href=\"?note=a5213da99983a05a\" title=\"89-lem-bisimulation-invariance\">89-lem-bisimulation-invariance</a> 对公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\varphi\">\\(\\Box\\varphi\\)</span> 的实例；\n不能只从 forth/back 条件跳过对子公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的归纳假设。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-bisimulation","status":"resolved","id":"f233d5485efaad7c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-bisimulation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-bisimulation-invariance","status":"resolved","id":"a5213da99983a05a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-bisimulation-invariance]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-bisimulation","status":"resolved","id":"f233d5485efaad7c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$Z$ : 互模拟 (see [[89-df-bisimulation]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\Box$ : 模态算子 (see [[89-df-box-modality]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-bisimulation-invariance","status":"resolved","id":"a5213da99983a05a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是 [[89-lem-bisimulation-invariance]] 对公式 $\\Box\\varphi$ 的实例；\n不能只从 forth/back 条件跳过对子公式 $\\varphi$ 的归纳假设。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"t